shape: sequence_diagram

title: Google sign-in {
  near: top-center
  shape: text
  style.font-size: 20
}

person: Person
client: Web or Android
google: Google
api: Function App
cosmos: Cosmos

person -> client: Sign in
client -> google: Google account
google -> client: ID token
client -> api: Authorization Bearer token
api -> api: Check signature, audience, and sub
api -> cosmos: Read or create the account document
cosmos -> api: Account
api -> cosmos: Read the items in this partition
cosmos -> api: Items
api -> client: That person's items
person -> client: Sign out
client -> client: Discard this client's token
